rooms_desc ({"This is the entrance hall to Totto's house.There are no windows here, just a little vase in the corner, and someracks where you can hang your clothes. If you go north you will enterthe livingroom.","You are in Totto's livingroom.The light is dimmed cause of all the spotlights carefully placed by Tottoaround in the room.  There is a big couch  in the right end corner, made in brown leater.It looks very comfortable.To the west is Totto's bedroom","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is the bedroom in Totto's mansion.A king sized bed is in the middle of the room, with white soft sheetsand a very comfortable looking mattress. It looks soooo comfy.There is a picture on the wall, it looks framed in. There is a radio herealso, playing soft romantic music, just perfect for a newlie-wed couple.The light in the room is very dimmed, making a very romantic athmosphere.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,})
